    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d645">

                <pb facs="0911" n="805" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg805"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador to
                        the Acting Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lenox, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Can you inform me whether United States Government intend to demand extradition
                    of Harry L. Holmes, now held at Montreal for theft?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Durand.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
